<view class="page with-dock"><view class="title">{{work.title}}</view><view class="subtitle">{{mode==='shots'?'逐镜记录':'作品深读'}} · 仅自己可见，不影响活动完成状态。</view><view wx:if="{{mode==='shots'}}"><button class="secondary" bindtap="chooseVideo">选择本地片段（不上传）</button><video wx:if="{{videoSrc}}" src="{{videoSrc}}" style="width:100%" controls/><view class="muted">时间从片段起点按秒记录。AI 只读取你填写的文字，不读取视频。</view><view wx:for="{{shots}}" wx:key="index" class="note-box"><view class="section-title">镜头 {{index+1}}</view><view class="row"><view class="grow"><view class="label">开始（秒）</view><input class="field" type="digit" value="{{item.start}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="start" bindinput="shotInput"/></view><view class="grow"><view class="label">结束（秒）</view><input class="field" type="digit" value="{{item.end}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="end" bindinput="shotInput"/></view></view><view class="label">实际看到 / 听到的证据</view><textarea class="textarea" value="{{item.evidence}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="evidence" bindinput="shotInput" maxlength="1000"/><view class="label">景别 / 构图</view><input class="field" value="{{item.composition}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="composition" bindinput="shotInput" maxlength="1000"/><view class="label">运镜 / 调度</view><input class="field" value="{{item.movement}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="movement" bindinput="shotInput" maxlength="1000"/><view class="label">剪点 / 转场</view><input class="field" value="{{item.cut}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="cut" bindinput="shotInput" maxlength="1000"/><view class="label">声音 / 音乐</view><input class="field" value="{{item.sound}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="sound" bindinput="shotInput" maxlength="1000"/><button class="quiet" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="remove">移除此镜头</button></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="addShot">添加镜头</button></view><view class="label">我的观察证据</view><textarea class="textarea" value="{{notes}}" data-field="notes" bindinput="input" maxlength="12000" placeholder="写下片段、人物选择、页码或镜头细节，区分事实与解释。"/><button class="secondary" bindtap="generate" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy||!services.ai}}">根据我的证据分析</button><view wx:if="{{!services.ai}}" class="notice">AI 尚未配置，可以直接保存观察笔记。</view><view wx:if="{{draft}}" class="note-box"><view>{{draft.summary}}</view><view wx:for="{{draft.claims}}" wx:key="quote" class="card"><view>“{{item.quote}}”</view><view>{{item.interpretation}}</view></view><view wx:for="{{draft.questions}}" wx:key="*this" class="muted">· {{item}}</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="adopt">采用到我的解读</button></view><view class="label">我的解读</view><textarea class="textarea" value="{{reflection}}" data-field="reflection" bindinput="input" maxlength="16000"/><button wx:if="{{original!==null}}" class="quiet" bindtap="restore">恢复采用前解读</button><view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="notice">{{notice}}</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view></view><view class="dock"><button loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="save">保存笔记</button></view>
